# Implementation constraints for <<NAME>>_top (ECP5).
#
# The target clock is not set here: `make impl` passes nextpnr --freq
# $(IMPL_FREQ_MHZ) so there is one place to change it.
#
# Pins are left unplaced on purpose: this flow measures the design's area and
# timing, it is not a board design. `make impl` passes nextpnr
# --lpf-allow-unconstrained so it places them itself. For a real board add, per
# port:
#   LOCATE COMP "clk" SITE "<ball>";
#   IOBUF PORT "clk" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33;
#
# Another top (IMPL_TOPLEVEL=<module>) needs its own synth/constraints/<module>.lpf.
